---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Learn how Ramzunā Languages collects, uses, and protects your personal information.">
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="bg-primary-600 py-16 lg:py-24 dark:bg-primary-900">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-primary-100">
        How we collect, use, and protect your personal information.
      </p>
      <nav class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-primary-200" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-white">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Ramzunā Languages is a British organisation that provides free and personalised English, French and German lessons to Palestinian students. We are committed to safeguarding the personal information of our students, teachers, team members, donors, partners, and website visitors.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you interact with our website, subscribe to our newsletter, participate in our programmes, contact us, or engage with us in any other way.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">1. Scope of This Policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">This Privacy Policy applies to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Learners studying with us
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Teachers and tutors
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Team members
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Applicants for programmes or positions
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Donors and partners
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Visitors to our website
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">We only collect the personal information that is necessary for us to deliver our programmes, process donations, maintain organisational operations, and communicate with our community.</p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Depending on your relationship with Ramzunā Languages, you may provide:</p>

        <h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Students</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          {['Full name', 'Date of birth', 'Gender', 'Nationality', 'Phone number', 'Email address', 'Country of residence', 'Proficiency level in English, French, or German', 'Education level/status', "Student's objectives"].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Teachers, Tutors, Team Members</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          {['Full name', 'Date of birth', 'Gender', 'Nationality', 'Phone number', 'Email address', 'Country of residence', 'Proficiency in English, French, or German', 'Proficiency in Arabic', 'Education/employment background', 'CV', 'Training answers', 'Background check (when working with minors)'].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Donors</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          {['Contact information (name, email, phone number)', 'Donation details', 'Communication and marketing preferences'].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">General Website Visitors</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          {['Information submitted through contact forms', 'Newsletter subscription details'].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Information Collected Automatically</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">When you browse our website, essential cookies may collect:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          {['Device and browser information', 'IP address', 'Time zone', 'General location (country)', 'Website performance indicators', 'Individual pages you viewed', 'Websites or search terms that referred you to our website'].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Our website is hosted on Hostinger.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">We process your information only to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          {['Respond to inquiries', 'Share updates, newsletters and campaign messages', 'Review volunteer and student applications', 'Facilitate onboarding and orientation', 'Enrol and match students with teachers', 'Manage our linguistic programmes, schedules, updates, and instructions', 'Communicate with our teachers, students, and team members', 'Track attendance and participation', 'Manage internal operations', 'Process donations'].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">4. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Ramzunā Languages neither sells nor trades personal information. We also do not share it with partner organisations, donors, funders, or third parties.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">5. Data Security</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">To keep personal data secure, we implement the following measures:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            All communications are conducted over fully encrypted channels (HTTPS).
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Only trusted, end-to-end encrypted applications are used for confidential discussions.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            All data is stored on open-source, end-to-end encrypted platforms.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Administrative accounts are protected through secure, multi-factor authentication procedures.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Data is retained solely for the minimum period necessary, in line with security and privacy best practices.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Ramzunā Languages retains data only as long as necessary for programme delivery. Default retention periods:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span><strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Student records:</strong> personal identifying data is permanently erased or irreversibly anonymised immediately upon a student's formal exit from the programme. If participation is temporarily paused, identifiable records are securely retained in restricted access for up to 6 months before erasure or anonymisation.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span><strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Volunteer records:</strong> 3 years after last engagement.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span><strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Email subscribers:</strong> until unsubscribed.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span><strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Website analytics:</strong> retained in accordance with the retention settings of our analytics and hosting services, periodically reviewed.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span><strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Internal communications:</strong> retained only as long as reasonably necessary for operational, safeguarding, legal, or administrative purposes, and periodically reviewed and deleted when no longer required.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">You have the following rights related to your personal data:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          {['The right to be informed.', 'The right of access.', 'The right to rectification.', 'The right to erasure.', 'The right to restrict processing.', 'The right to data portability.', 'The right to object.', 'Rights in relation to automated decision-making and profiling.'].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">If you would like to exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:contacteam@ramzunalanguages.org" class="break-all text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-400 dark:hover:text-primary-300">contacteam@ramzunalanguages.org</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">8. Communications and Organisational Updates</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Ramzunā Languages communicates with volunteers, applicants, students, newsletter subscribers, partners, and other participants regarding recruitment, onboarding, training, safeguarding, programme activities, organisational updates, and other matters relevant to their involvement with the organisation. Anyone who subscribes to our newsletters via our website may unsubscribe at any time.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">9. Links to Other Websites</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Our website may contain links to other websites that are not owned or controlled by us. Please be aware that we are not responsible for the privacy practices of other websites or third parties. We encourage you to review and read the privacy statements of each website that may collect personal information.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">10. Updates to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices, legal requirements, or organisational needs.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">11. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal data, please contact:</p>
        <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-cream-100 p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Ramzunā Languages</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Email: <a href="mailto:contacteam@ramzunalanguages.org" class="break-all text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-400 dark:hover:text-primary-300">contacteam@ramzunalanguages.org</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
